Licensing of this repository
============================

This repository contains two different kinds of material, and they are licensed
differently. Nothing here is licensed "all rights reserved" — that would be
incompatible with the projects this work derives from.

See ATTRIBUTION.md for who wrote the software these patches apply to.


1. The patch files (patches/*.patch)
------------------------------------

Each patch is a derivative work of the project it modifies, and is offered
under that project's own license — not under a license chosen here:

  patches/01-openemu-sdk-controller-crash.patch
      derives from OpenEmu-SDK, Copyright (c) 2009 OpenEmu Team
      -> BSD 3-Clause

  patches/02-nestopia-return-nil.patch
      derives from Nestopia-Core, Copyright (c) 2018 OpenEmu Team
      -> BSD 3-Clause

  patches/03-desmume-nds-arm64.patch
      derives from DeSmuME, Copyright (C) 2007 Tim Seidel,
      Copyright (C) 2008-2015 DeSmuME team
      -> GNU General Public License, version 2 or later

  patches/04-reicast-dreamcast-arm64.patch
      derives from reicast, Copyright (c) reicast team and contributors
      -> GNU General Public License, version 2

  patches/05-ppsspp-remove-agl.patch
      derives from PPSSPP, Copyright (c) 2012- PPSSPP Project
      -> GNU General Public License, version 2 or later

The unified diffs necessarily quote a small amount of surrounding upstream code
as context (roughly 110 lines in total). That code remains the property of its
authors under the licenses above. Distributing changes as patches is the normal,
intended mechanism for these projects.

Full license texts are distributed with each upstream project and are not
duplicated here, to avoid any suggestion that this repository is the origin of
that code.


