3. If you distribute a build made with these scripts
----------------------------------------------------

A compiled OpenEmu built this way contains GPL-licensed emulator cores
(DeSmuME, reicast, PPSSPP, Mupen64Plus, Nestopia and others). Under the GPL,
anyone you give a binary to is entitled to the corresponding source. To satisfy
that:

  - keep this repository public, and link it from every release, and
  - keep ATTRIBUTION.md inside the distributed archive.

Label such builds "unofficial". They are not produced or endorsed by the OpenEmu
project, and its maintainers should not receive support requests for them.


4. What is not here
-------------------

No ROMs, BIOS images, firmware, game assets, or other copyrighted media are
included in this repository, and none should ever be added to it. The build
scripts do not download any such material. Users must supply their own.
